WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.933 --> 00:00:05.059
Did you see it?

2
00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:05.977
I did.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.353
That E-Rank hunter. right?

4
00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:11.524
He's getting in shape. right?

5
00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:14.485
His looks are average. but he is cute.

6
00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:19.866
The type that surprises you
when he undresses?

7
00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:21.826
Since when did we have someone like that?

8
00:00:21.909 --> 00:00:23.411
I completely missed it.

9
00:00:26.748 --> 00:00:28.750
He was unremarkable at first.

10
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:32.336
But he has been in shape
since he started working out.

11
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.463
Really?

12
00:00:33.546 --> 00:00:35.590
Can people gain muscles so quickly?

13
00:00:37.175 --> 00:00:38.092
Excuse me.

14
00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:39.677
Mr. Sung Jinwoo.

15
00:00:42.221 --> 00:00:43.139
Ah.

16
00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:45.266
Sorry.

17
00:00:45.349 --> 00:00:47.643
No. I should apologize.

18
00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.523
His muscles are so firm.

19
00:00:54.358 --> 00:00:58.196
Did he have such a good physique before?

20
00:00:58.279 --> 00:01:00.656
What do you want to tell me?

21
00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.283
Ah. right.

22
00:01:02.366 --> 00:01:04.452
Today is your day of discharge.

23
00:01:04.535 --> 00:01:05.787
Do you have any discomfort?

24
00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.955
No. thanks to you. I've fully recovered.

25
00:01:08.039 --> 00:01:09.165
I see.

26
00:01:09.248 --> 00:01:12.668
Then. please complete the procedures
at the counter later.

27
00:01:12.752 --> 00:01:13.586
Okay.

28
00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:14.670
Thank you for everything.

29
00:01:17.548 --> 00:01:18.925
- Well...
- Yes?

30
00:01:19.926 --> 00:01:22.678
Could you give me your contact?

31
00:01:22.762 --> 00:01:24.514
Contact?

32
00:01:24.597 --> 00:01:25.640
Yes.

33
00:01:25.723 --> 00:01:27.475
If you don't mind.

34
00:01:28.059 --> 00:01:31.187
Will they inform me of the examination
results after my discharge?

35
00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.188
I understand.

36
00:03:08.159 --> 00:03:10.036
Good morning. everyone.

37
00:03:10.119 --> 00:03:12.288
This is our special guest for today.

38
00:03:12.371 --> 00:03:14.540
Hello. I'm Baek Yoonho.

39
00:03:15.374 --> 00:03:16.709
Hunter Baek

40
00:03:16.792 --> 00:03:22.131
is one of seven S-Rank hunters and
has had impressive achievements.

41
00:03:22.214 --> 00:03:26.719
What kind of life do you lead
when you're not on missions?

42
00:03:26.802 --> 00:03:27.720
Well.

43
00:03:27.803 --> 00:03:29.639
it's mainly training.

44
00:03:29.722 --> 00:03:31.641
Daily training is indispensable.

45
00:03:32.225 --> 00:03:34.936
If I don't simulate actual combat.

46
00:03:35.019 --> 00:03:36.395
my skills would get rusty.

47
00:03:36.479 --> 00:03:37.730
Every day?

48
00:03:37.813 --> 00:03:39.440
Is it not tiring?

49
00:03:40.149 --> 00:03:43.069
I was a firefighter before.

50
00:03:43.152 --> 00:03:45.738
I'm used to regular training.

51
00:03:46.322 --> 00:03:49.867
A small mistake of mine could
endanger my companions' lives.

52
00:03:49.951 --> 00:03:52.495
That always makes me tense up.

53
00:03:52.578 --> 00:03:53.663
I see.

54
00:03:55.331 --> 00:03:56.958
It's so late?

55
00:03:59.669 --> 00:04:01.295
Brother.

56
00:04:01.379 --> 00:04:03.214
Jinah. morning.

57
00:04:03.297 --> 00:04:04.298
You're up?

58
00:04:04.882 --> 00:04:06.384
I've been up for a while.

59
00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.386
Be careful on the road.

60
00:04:08.469 --> 00:04:12.890
The meal I made yesterday
is in the fridge...

61
00:04:14.016 --> 00:04:16.227
Brother. have you been exercising?

62
00:04:17.019 --> 00:04:18.688
Uh... a little.

63
00:04:19.272 --> 00:04:21.148
Have you gotten taller too?

64
00:04:21.232 --> 00:04:22.650
Because of exercising?

65
00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:26.362
Men can grow after
they've reached adulthood?

66
00:04:30.157 --> 00:04:31.367
I'm heading out.

67
00:04:32.785 --> 00:04:33.619
Hey.

68
00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.705
you forgot the umbrella.

69
00:04:36.205 --> 00:04:38.374
The weather is nice. I'm not
taking the heavy umbrella.

70
00:04:38.457 --> 00:04:40.334
It's not heavy.

71
00:04:40.418 --> 00:04:42.545
I said no.

72
00:04:42.628 --> 00:04:44.588
Better safe than sorry.

73
00:04:44.672 --> 00:04:45.548
Go.

74
00:04:45.631 --> 00:04:48.384
Geez. I'm leaving.

75
00:04:48.467 --> 00:04:49.468
Be careful.

76
00:04:53.973 --> 00:04:55.850
I'll run later.

77
00:04:56.434 --> 00:04:59.520
The muscle I've gained must
be due to the ability stats.

78
00:05:00.354 --> 00:05:03.983
If I keep training.
I might become a bodybuilder.

79
00:05:06.402 --> 00:05:08.904
I still have some points left.

80
00:05:08.988 --> 00:05:11.490
Which one should I choose?

81
00:05:12.116 --> 00:05:14.285
I need strength to increase damage.

82
00:05:14.368 --> 00:05:17.163
But it's pointless
if I can't hit the target.

83
00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:18.998
Then I need to improve agility.

84
00:05:19.623 --> 00:05:21.625
I'll boost both strength and agility.

85
00:05:21.709 --> 00:05:23.627
It's also good to enhance vitality.

86
00:05:23.711 --> 00:05:25.338
Perception is useful too.

87
00:05:25.421 --> 00:05:26.839
As for intelligence...

88
00:05:26.922 --> 00:05:30.092
It feels related to magic. Do I need it?

89
00:05:31.135 --> 00:05:32.178
Okay. I've decided.

90
00:05:34.346 --> 00:05:35.639
That should do it.

91
00:05:37.058 --> 00:05:37.933
LANDLORD

92
00:05:38.017 --> 00:05:40.102
Hello. this is Sung Jinwoo.

93
00:05:40.186 --> 00:05:41.562
You finally answered the phone.

94
00:05:41.645 --> 00:05:44.482
Sorry. I was hospitalized.

95
00:05:44.565 --> 00:05:46.358
I need to pay the rent. right?

96
00:05:46.442 --> 00:05:47.276
Yes.

97
00:05:47.359 --> 00:05:49.904
I still haven't received
the rent for this month.

98
00:05:49.987 --> 00:05:52.114
If you're tight on money.
I can collect it later.

99
00:05:52.198 --> 00:05:54.742
Ah. no. I'll transfer it in a bit.

100
00:05:54.825 --> 00:05:56.494
I see. Appreciate it.

101
00:05:56.577 --> 00:05:58.788
Take care.

102
00:05:58.871 --> 00:06:00.873
Okay. thank you.

103
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:06.837
I don't know if the phenomenon
on me is a second awakening.

104
00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.383
But now I can kill goblins in an instant.

105
00:06:11.467 --> 00:06:13.677
I should be able to earn the rent easily.

106
00:06:15.888 --> 00:06:16.764
That being said.

107
00:06:16.847 --> 00:06:19.725
it's not so easy to find work.

108
00:06:20.309 --> 00:06:23.813
I need to enter higher-level
gates to make money.

109
00:06:23.896 --> 00:06:24.980
However.

110
00:06:25.064 --> 00:06:28.776
an E-Rank hunter like me
has no chance of getting in.

111
00:06:29.527 --> 00:06:31.529
Should I go for a re-evaluation?

112
00:06:31.612 --> 00:06:32.738
If my hunter rank is higher.

113
00:06:32.822 --> 00:06:34.573
I could enter the high-level gates.

114
00:06:34.657 --> 00:06:37.201
The more attention I get.
the more money I might make.

115
00:06:37.952 --> 00:06:39.453
But it would attract too much attention.

116
00:06:40.371 --> 00:06:42.665
People with second awakening are rare.

117
00:06:43.249 --> 00:06:47.628
Not to mention hunters who grow
stronger as their level increases.

118
00:06:48.295 --> 00:06:51.048
That would attract a lot
of unnecessary attention.

119
00:06:51.132 --> 00:06:53.134
The media are annoying.

120
00:06:53.217 --> 00:06:55.261
I might even become a target.

121
00:06:55.928 --> 00:06:57.304
Better not.

122
00:06:57.388 --> 00:06:59.974
At least I should be able
to protect myself first.

123
00:07:00.057 --> 00:07:01.100
Also.

124
00:07:01.183 --> 00:07:03.519
it's better to keep it down
before I know what this power is.

125
00:07:16.532 --> 00:07:17.783
Confirm.

126
00:07:19.326 --> 00:07:20.494
Hello there.

127
00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.790
I'm Hwang Dongsuk.

128
00:07:24.874 --> 00:07:26.000
I'm Sung Jinwoo.

129
00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:26.917
An E-Rank. right?

130
00:07:27.001 --> 00:07:27.835
Yes.

131
00:07:27.918 --> 00:07:29.753
Ah. I know him.

132
00:07:29.837 --> 00:07:32.047
He's super famous.

133
00:07:32.131 --> 00:07:35.801
I remember his nickname is
The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind.

134
00:07:36.552 --> 00:07:37.386
What the heck?

135
00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.762
Hey. stop this.

136
00:07:38.846 --> 00:07:40.890
Sorry. my members are rude.

137
00:07:40.973 --> 00:07:43.851
No. it's true that I am an E-Rank hunter.

138
00:07:43.934 --> 00:07:45.436
Can I join?

139
00:07:45.519 --> 00:07:47.021
No problem.

140
00:07:47.104 --> 00:07:49.982
I just need you to make up the numbers.

141
00:07:50.691 --> 00:07:53.444
I said it over the phone.
but let me confirm it again.

142
00:07:53.527 --> 00:07:57.573
At least eight people are required
to enter this C-Rank dungeon.

143
00:07:57.656 --> 00:08:00.451
And half of them must be C-Rank.

144
00:08:01.035 --> 00:08:04.997
You're not counted as combat power.
so you will not share the spoils.

145
00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:08.667
However. we will pay your
commission fee of 2 million in cash.

146
00:08:10.544 --> 00:08:13.839
Four C-Rank hunters
and two D-Rank or lower ones?

147
00:08:14.507 --> 00:08:15.674
I understand.

148
00:08:15.758 --> 00:08:17.426
What should I do?

149
00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.303
You'll carry the luggage.

150
00:08:19.887 --> 00:08:22.723
Inside are bento meals
as well as spare clothes and equipment.

151
00:08:22.806 --> 00:08:24.391
There's also a first aid kit.

152
00:08:24.475 --> 00:08:27.811
You're not bringing a healer in?

153
00:08:27.895 --> 00:08:31.190
It's difficult for private teams
like us to recruit healers.

154
00:08:31.273 --> 00:08:32.566
You should know that.

155
00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.486
We have always managed like this.

156
00:08:35.569 --> 00:08:36.946
Yes.

157
00:08:37.029 --> 00:08:40.324
A team with only Tankers and Fighters?

158
00:08:40.407 --> 00:08:41.659
They are reckless.

159
00:08:42.368 --> 00:08:45.079
And the fact that there's
no healer is quite concerning.

160
00:08:45.162 --> 00:08:47.706
Then please sign the contract.

161
00:08:49.375 --> 00:08:54.338
The other party won't be held accountable
for any incidents in the dungeon.

162
00:08:54.421 --> 00:08:55.339
Done.

163
00:08:55.422 --> 00:08:56.423
Thank you.

164
00:08:58.968 --> 00:09:01.720
We are the same.

165
00:09:02.304 --> 00:09:05.266
My name is Yoo Jinho.
21 years old. a D-Rank hunter.

166
00:09:05.349 --> 00:09:07.685
I was also brought in to make up numbers.

167
00:09:07.768 --> 00:09:08.811
Okay.

168
00:09:08.894 --> 00:09:10.688
D-Rank with such gears?

169
00:09:10.771 --> 00:09:13.023
His family must be rich.

170
00:09:13.732 --> 00:09:15.859
Is this your first time
in a C-Rank dungeon?

171
00:09:16.569 --> 00:09:17.486
Don't worry.

172
00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.405
I will protect you.

173
00:09:23.325 --> 00:09:24.868
Let's go then.

174
00:09:25.452 --> 00:09:26.996
Aren't the bags heavy?

175
00:09:27.079 --> 00:09:28.038
Are you okay?

176
00:09:28.581 --> 00:09:30.958
Yes. I'm fine.

177
00:09:31.041 --> 00:09:32.501
I am younger than you.

178
00:09:32.585 --> 00:09:34.378
You don't have to speak so formally.

179
00:09:35.337 --> 00:09:36.755
I understand.

180
00:09:36.839 --> 00:09:40.301
Have you heard? The president
who marked this project

181
00:09:40.384 --> 00:09:43.887
escaped abroad with 900 billion
funds two months ago.

182
00:09:43.971 --> 00:09:46.765
The employees and investors
are all complaining.

183
00:09:46.849 --> 00:09:48.017
Okay.

184
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.186
Ah... Did I talk too much again?

185
00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.481
I'm not used to paying
attention to people's reactions.

186
00:09:57.568 --> 00:09:58.444
This is it.

187
00:09:58.527 --> 00:10:01.864
Wow. what a large entrance.

188
00:10:01.947 --> 00:10:04.408
Such size is really rare.

189
00:10:05.284 --> 00:10:08.287
Dongsuk. is this really a C-Rank gate?

190
00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.705
Isn't it too big?

191
00:10:09.788 --> 00:10:14.126
The investigators confirmed twice
before giving a C-Rank evaluation.

192
00:10:14.209 --> 00:10:15.377
Then it must be C-Rank.

193
00:10:15.461 --> 00:10:17.338
This gate is huge.

194
00:10:17.421 --> 00:10:19.089
Is it okay to enter?

195
00:10:19.173 --> 00:10:21.467
The size of the gate isn't very important.

196
00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.345
What matters is the flux of magic
power emanating from inside.

197
00:10:25.137 --> 00:10:28.724
The Association will measure
that value and classify it.

198
00:10:28.807 --> 00:10:33.062
Normally. B-Rank and above dungeons
are handled by large guilds.

199
00:10:33.145 --> 00:10:35.564
Those below C-Rank aren't as dangerous.

200
00:10:36.231 --> 00:10:38.442
You know a lot about this. Jinwoo.

201
00:10:38.525 --> 00:10:40.527
I have been a hunter for some time.

202
00:10:41.737 --> 00:10:42.821
But still.

203
00:10:42.905 --> 00:10:44.740
this is my first time in a C-Rank dungeon.

204
00:10:45.324 --> 00:10:47.576
Please follow me.

205
00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.619
Yes.

206
00:10:48.702 --> 00:10:50.496
Jinwoo. let's go.

207
00:10:51.747 --> 00:10:53.332
Hmm... got it.

208
00:10:57.836 --> 00:10:59.963
Kyuhwan. some light.

209
00:11:00.047 --> 00:11:01.048
Yes.

210
00:11:04.968 --> 00:11:06.804
What's going on here?

211
00:11:06.887 --> 00:11:08.347
Not a single magic beast.

212
00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.224
And pitch black.

213
00:11:10.307 --> 00:11:12.893
There are normally luminescent
stones in dungeons.

214
00:11:13.727 --> 00:11:14.853
A pitch-black dungeon

215
00:11:15.646 --> 00:11:17.689
reminds me of the Cartenon Temple.

216
00:11:18.482 --> 00:11:19.733
Jinwoo.

217
00:11:19.817 --> 00:11:21.735
what is "luminescent stone"?

218
00:11:21.819 --> 00:11:22.986
Well.

219
00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:27.950
luminescent stones are glowing rocks
that are common in cave-like dungeons.

220
00:11:28.575 --> 00:11:31.078
They are usually found
on the walls or the floor.

221
00:11:31.161 --> 00:11:32.955
emitting a faint light to illuminate
the insides of the cave.

222
00:11:33.831 --> 00:11:37.626
So. the magic gems
obtained from magic beasts.

223
00:11:37.709 --> 00:11:40.629
the mana crystals collected in dungeons.

224
00:11:40.712 --> 00:11:44.216
and the luminescent stones
that light up the caves.

225
00:11:44.299 --> 00:11:46.093
They are quite confusing.

226
00:11:46.176 --> 00:11:47.928
You will get used to it soon.

227
00:11:50.973 --> 00:11:54.601
By the way. there's nothing here.

228
00:11:54.685 --> 00:11:55.602
Jinwoo.

229
00:11:55.686 --> 00:11:57.688
Can there be a dungeon
without magic beasts?

230
00:11:57.771 --> 00:11:58.939
Shh.

231
00:12:00.899 --> 00:12:02.568
This sound.

232
00:12:02.651 --> 00:12:05.779
There are magic beasts here.
They just haven't shown up.

233
00:12:05.863 --> 00:12:06.738
Get ready.

234
00:12:06.822 --> 00:12:08.198
Yes.

235
00:12:08.282 --> 00:12:10.534
Moving as a group in the dark.

236
00:12:10.617 --> 00:12:12.786
and swarming towards any light source.

237
00:12:13.745 --> 00:12:15.414
Insect-type magic beasts!

238
00:12:15.497 --> 00:12:17.082
- Insects.
- Darn it.

239
00:12:17.166 --> 00:12:18.000
Insects. of all things.

240
00:12:18.083 --> 00:12:19.918
Dongsuk. do you see anything?

241
00:12:20.002 --> 00:12:21.336
No. I can't see a thing.

242
00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.172
Is this an ant nest?

243
00:12:23.255 --> 00:12:24.798
Then we're in trouble.

244
00:12:24.882 --> 00:12:26.383
The sounds are getting closer.

245
00:12:26.467 --> 00:12:27.843
Where will they emerge from?

246
00:12:27.926 --> 00:12:29.303
There are too many holes here.

247
00:12:30.637 --> 00:12:31.763
Above!

248
00:12:35.392 --> 00:12:37.019
Kyuhwan.

249
00:12:39.062 --> 00:12:41.273
- I'll draw their attention.
- Yes.

250
00:12:41.356 --> 00:12:44.026
Jinwoo. please don't leave my side.

251
00:12:46.528 --> 00:12:48.947
Look over here. bugs!

252
00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.077
Amazing. all the bugs are
heading towards Hwang.

253
00:12:54.161 --> 00:12:55.621
It's a taunting skill.

254
00:12:56.121 --> 00:12:57.748
C-Rank hunters are indeed better.

255
00:12:59.249 --> 00:13:01.376
Jinsuk. 11 o'clock direction.

256
00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.419
Understood.

257
00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.005
- I'll also...
- Step back.

258
00:13:05.088 --> 00:13:06.298
Start the countdown.

259
00:13:06.381 --> 00:13:10.886
5. 4. 3. 2. 1.

260
00:13:10.969 --> 00:13:12.137
0.

261
00:13:12.221 --> 00:13:13.597
This is my trump card.

262
00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.474
Take this.

263
00:13:16.725 --> 00:13:18.352
Good. take them down.

264
00:13:18.852 --> 00:13:19.895
I've been waiting.

265
00:13:19.978 --> 00:13:21.647
Good teamwork.

266
00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.858
They've been working together for long.

267
00:13:25.442 --> 00:13:28.779
Maybe it's because they
don't have a healer.

268
00:13:28.862 --> 00:13:29.780
the way they fight is rough.

269
00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.366
As for Jinho...

270
00:13:33.242 --> 00:13:35.744
His equipment compensates
for the lack of strength.

271
00:13:38.038 --> 00:13:40.499
Everyone is doing well.

272
00:13:42.084 --> 00:13:43.585
but I feel

273
00:13:47.172 --> 00:13:48.382
a bit unsettled.

274
00:13:49.258 --> 00:13:50.592
Alright.

275
00:13:50.676 --> 00:13:52.010
This should be the last one.

276
00:13:52.094 --> 00:13:53.345
Jinsuk.

277
00:13:54.638 --> 00:13:56.348
Yes. no more enemies.

278
00:13:56.431 --> 00:13:57.432
All taken care of.

279
00:13:57.516 --> 00:13:59.268
Good. it's over.

280
00:13:59.351 --> 00:14:01.895
Take all the magic gems and
split them into seven parts.

281
00:14:01.979 --> 00:14:03.397
Yeah.

282
00:14:04.523 --> 00:14:06.191
I love this moment.

283
00:14:06.275 --> 00:14:07.859
Me too.

284
00:14:07.943 --> 00:14:09.945
Thanks for your help.

285
00:14:10.028 --> 00:14:12.322
It would have been dangerous
if we had discovered them later.

286
00:14:12.406 --> 00:14:13.448
It's okay.

287
00:14:13.532 --> 00:14:16.034
How did you know they were above?

288
00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:17.995
It's intuition.

289
00:14:18.787 --> 00:14:21.123
Your intuition is surely sharp.

290
00:14:21.206 --> 00:14:22.416
Dongsuk.

291
00:14:22.499 --> 00:14:24.293
Come take a look at this.

292
00:14:24.376 --> 00:14:26.169
Look at their wounds.

293
00:14:26.253 --> 00:14:27.963
These aren't sword wounds.

294
00:14:28.046 --> 00:14:31.216
No. they don't look like burns
caused by magic either.

295
00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:36.179
Many of them were
bitten to death like this.

296
00:14:36.263 --> 00:14:39.099
Did the magic beasts fight
each other over territory?

297
00:14:39.182 --> 00:14:43.729
So there must be a stronger
magic beast around here.

298
00:14:44.605 --> 00:14:45.731
Is that so?

299
00:14:45.814 --> 00:14:48.650
A high-rank beast
that preys on these insects.

300
00:14:50.485 --> 00:14:54.156
Did you see the way
I slayed the magic beasts?

301
00:14:54.239 --> 00:14:55.115
Yeah.

302
00:14:56.116 --> 00:14:56.950
Jinho.

303
00:14:57.034 --> 00:14:59.369
Your sword and shield
are expensive. right?

304
00:14:59.453 --> 00:15:00.996
Eh? Yeah.

305
00:15:01.079 --> 00:15:02.456
Because this is my first mission.

306
00:15:02.539 --> 00:15:05.000
My father bought me high-quality gear.

307
00:15:05.083 --> 00:15:06.335
I see.

308
00:15:06.418 --> 00:15:07.961
I don't know for sure yet.

309
00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.005
but it's better to be cautious.

310
00:15:18.722 --> 00:15:19.556
Ha!

311
00:15:20.307 --> 00:15:22.351
What was that sound? An explosion?

312
00:15:22.434 --> 00:15:25.145
Stay calm. it happens all the time here.

313
00:15:25.228 --> 00:15:26.104
Look.

314
00:15:27.397 --> 00:15:29.650
The guild master is in training.

315
00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.615
Amazing.

316
00:15:36.698 --> 00:15:38.617
He pierced through
that huge boulder in one strike.

317
00:15:41.119 --> 00:15:43.497
This isn't even a warm-up.

318
00:15:44.081 --> 00:15:46.416
Hey. clean this up.

319
00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:51.004
We've been walking for quite a while.

320
00:15:51.588 --> 00:15:52.547
The size of the dungeon...

321
00:15:52.631 --> 00:15:54.841
Is unrelated to its level. right?

322
00:15:54.925 --> 00:15:57.511
It's related to the flux of magic power.

323
00:15:57.594 --> 00:16:01.598
Although the dungeon is big.
it's quite empty. right?

324
00:16:01.682 --> 00:16:02.891
Yes.

325
00:16:02.975 --> 00:16:06.520
But transporting luggage becomes
quite laborious in such a big dungeon.

326
00:16:06.603 --> 00:16:08.772
Jinwoo. can you still manage?

327
00:16:08.855 --> 00:16:10.983
It's not that heavy.

328
00:16:11.066 --> 00:16:15.112
It's good to earn money
without having to fight.

329
00:16:16.279 --> 00:16:18.156
A good deal.

330
00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.157
No.

331
00:16:19.241 --> 00:16:20.909
Too good. actually.

332
00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.036
I have a feeling there's something fishy.

333
00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.375
A battle-hardened team
yet without a healer.

334
00:16:29.376 --> 00:16:31.253
And they even needed
to make up the number.

335
00:16:31.837 --> 00:16:33.422
These magic beasts are also half-dead.

336
00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.299
Nice.

337
00:16:36.383 --> 00:16:37.259
Oh.

338
00:16:37.759 --> 00:16:39.553
It really is strange.

339
00:16:39.636 --> 00:16:43.432
We haven't encountered a single
uninjured magic beast during the walk.

340
00:16:44.016 --> 00:16:46.685
All we've seen are either corpses
or those barely alive.

341
00:16:46.768 --> 00:16:48.687
The boss should be somewhere.

342
00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.897
If there's no BOSS. the gate won't open.

343
00:16:51.857 --> 00:16:53.025
Wait.

344
00:16:53.108 --> 00:16:54.818
Kyuhwan. light it up.

345
00:16:54.901 --> 00:16:55.986
Okay.

346
00:17:00.615 --> 00:17:03.285
I think the Boss room should be ahead.

347
00:17:03.368 --> 00:17:04.661
Let's go.

348
00:17:16.423 --> 00:17:17.674
This is...

349
00:17:17.758 --> 00:17:18.592
Unbelievable.

350
00:17:18.675 --> 00:17:20.552
Mana crystals!

351
00:17:20.635 --> 00:17:22.888
There's quite a lot.

352
00:17:22.971 --> 00:17:25.140
It's not as valuable as the magic gem.

353
00:17:25.223 --> 00:17:26.141
but the amount...

354
00:17:26.224 --> 00:17:29.144
They are worth about a billion.

355
00:17:29.227 --> 00:17:30.395
Dongsuk.

356
00:17:30.479 --> 00:17:33.023
Your brother will be green with envy.

357
00:17:33.106 --> 00:17:34.107
Hey.

358
00:17:34.191 --> 00:17:37.277
Don't bring up his brother.

359
00:17:37.903 --> 00:17:40.739
Dongsoo. I've told you.

360
00:17:40.822 --> 00:17:43.658
You're not always right.

361
00:17:43.742 --> 00:17:47.788
I'm no longer the guy who always
listens to his younger brother.

362
00:17:47.871 --> 00:17:51.917
I will use these as capital
to build my team.

363
00:17:52.501 --> 00:17:53.710
We've really rich.

364
00:17:53.794 --> 00:17:56.171
Everyone will get well over 100 million.

365
00:17:56.254 --> 00:17:57.589
How are we going to move these out?

366
00:17:57.672 --> 00:17:58.673
Jinwoo.

367
00:17:58.757 --> 00:18:00.759
Please let me see your contract.

368
00:18:00.842 --> 00:18:02.844
I know the law very well.

369
00:18:02.928 --> 00:18:03.804
Okay.

370
00:18:04.971 --> 00:18:06.932
Excuse me. may I ask you something?

371
00:18:07.015 --> 00:18:07.849
What?

372
00:18:07.933 --> 00:18:10.727
This is the contract
you signed with Jinwoo.

373
00:18:10.811 --> 00:18:13.313
It only mentions
the ownership of the spoils.

374
00:18:13.897 --> 00:18:17.317
But mana crystals don't count as spoils.

375
00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.904
So it should be divided
into eight parts. right?

376
00:18:20.987 --> 00:18:22.280
Of course.

377
00:18:22.364 --> 00:18:23.698
We must do it fairly.

378
00:18:23.782 --> 00:18:25.408
I'm clear on that.

379
00:18:25.909 --> 00:18:27.285
However.

380
00:18:27.369 --> 00:18:29.246
we need to deal with that guy first.

381
00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.540
The dungeon Boss.

382
00:18:31.623 --> 00:18:32.958
I think you understand this.

383
00:18:33.041 --> 00:18:35.794
After defeating the Boss.
the gate will close.

384
00:18:35.877 --> 00:18:39.965
So we must move all the mana crystals
out before defeating that spider.

385
00:18:40.882 --> 00:18:43.385
Luckily. it's sleeping.

386
00:18:43.468 --> 00:18:46.513
Now might be a great opportunity to mine.

387
00:18:46.596 --> 00:18:48.306
Lee Chul-jin. where are our tools?

388
00:18:49.641 --> 00:18:52.894
I didn't know there'd be so many.

389
00:18:52.978 --> 00:18:56.064
I left the tools in the car.

390
00:18:56.148 --> 00:18:58.984
Haven't I always told you
to keep the tools with you?

391
00:18:59.067 --> 00:19:00.819
I'm really sorry.

392
00:19:00.902 --> 00:19:02.279
Sorry.

393
00:19:02.362 --> 00:19:04.698
Can you two stay here?

394
00:19:04.781 --> 00:19:06.366
We need to get the tools.

395
00:19:06.449 --> 00:19:07.325
Huh?

396
00:19:07.409 --> 00:19:10.120
Just the two of us in the Boss room?

397
00:19:10.203 --> 00:19:11.663
Don't worry.

398
00:19:11.746 --> 00:19:14.499
It should be full and sound asleep.

399
00:19:14.583 --> 00:19:17.627
It should be fine for now
as long as you don't provoke it.

400
00:19:17.711 --> 00:19:18.628
But...

401
00:19:18.712 --> 00:19:20.964
Yoo. it's your first mission. right?

402
00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.093
Mr. Sung. this is also your first time
at a C-Rank dungeon. isn't it?

403
00:19:25.677 --> 00:19:27.137
Just trust me. guys.

404
00:19:27.637 --> 00:19:29.097
Okay?

405
00:19:29.639 --> 00:19:31.516
I need to tell my members something.

406
00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.102
I'll come back after a smoke.

407
00:19:34.186 --> 00:19:35.270
According to the rules.

408
00:19:35.353 --> 00:19:38.857
at least eight people are needed
to conquer a C-Rank dungeon.

409
00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.944
Excluding Jinho and me.
this team originally had six people.

410
00:19:43.028 --> 00:19:45.488
We have always managed like this.

411
00:19:46.072 --> 00:19:48.325
He said always. which means...

412
00:19:48.408 --> 00:19:51.203
They often conquer C-Rank dungeons.

413
00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.498
They should have regulars
to make up the numbers.

414
00:19:56.499 --> 00:19:57.918
Kyuhwan.

415
00:19:58.001 --> 00:20:00.879
Block the entrance to the Boss room.

416
00:20:06.092 --> 00:20:07.177
The entrance is...

417
00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:08.428
What is this?

418
00:20:09.137 --> 00:20:11.640
Did they betray us?

419
00:20:11.723 --> 00:20:13.308
As expected.

420
00:20:13.391 --> 00:20:14.976
They are...

421
00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.687
Sometimes you just come
across such scumbags.

422
00:20:18.688 --> 00:20:22.359
This work is inherently dangerous.
and accidents are par for the course.

423
00:20:22.859 --> 00:20:25.654
But even if an accident happens.

424
00:20:25.737 --> 00:20:30.075
it won't be made public.
hence the crime rate is high.

425
00:20:30.742 --> 00:20:33.495
There are no surveillance
cameras in the dungeons.

426
00:20:33.578 --> 00:20:36.581
If everyone is dead.
there's no evidence left.

427
00:20:36.665 --> 00:20:40.627
They use the weak as bait
to lure the enemy

428
00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.212
or abandon them in there.

429
00:20:42.754 --> 00:20:43.797
In simple terms.

430
00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.007
it's like a gecko dropping
its tail to survive.

431
00:20:47.217 --> 00:20:51.513
They plan to kill us over
a few mana crystals.

432
00:20:53.473 --> 00:20:57.727
I talked too much about the contract.

433
00:20:58.895 --> 00:20:59.980
No.

434
00:21:00.063 --> 00:21:01.106
No matter what the situation is.

435
00:21:02.232 --> 00:21:05.235
they will kill us immediately
if we act rashly.

436
00:21:06.361 --> 00:21:07.612
More importantly...

437
00:21:11.616 --> 00:21:13.076
Jinwoo. please step back.

438
00:21:13.159 --> 00:21:14.744
I will figure out a way.

439
00:21:15.662 --> 00:21:17.872
We should be able to get out from there.

440
00:21:17.956 --> 00:21:19.582
This must be their plan.

441
00:21:25.922 --> 00:21:27.674
C-Rank Boss.

442
00:21:28.508 --> 00:21:29.968
And E-Rank hunter.

443
00:21:31.219 --> 00:21:33.054
The difference in strength is too great.

444
00:21:38.518 --> 00:21:40.103
But...

445
00:21:40.812 --> 00:21:42.063
Is it?

446
00:21:43.982 --> 00:21:45.775
I take back what I said.

447
00:21:45.859 --> 00:21:48.069
Jinho. stay put.

448
00:21:48.153 --> 00:21:49.321
I'll handle this guy.

449
00:21:49.404 --> 00:21:50.697
Huh?

450
00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:51.906
What did you just say?

451
00:21:58.955 --> 00:22:00.290
I'll take it down.
